1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,235
先看一个来自本周代码的谜题
Here's a puzzle from this week's code.

2
00:00:02,555 --> 00:00:05,365
setup 崩溃了，报的是 AttributeError
Setup crashes with an attribute error:

3
00:00:05,365 --> 00:00:09,211
scGenModel 没有叫 x_dimensions 的属性——结尾带 s 的那个
scGenModel has no attribute x_dimensions, with an s.

4
00:00:09,367 --> 00:00:14,299
看起来改一个字母就能修好：删掉 s，崩溃就消失了
The fix looks like one letter. Delete the s, and the crash disappears.

5
00:00:14,299 --> 00:00:18,948
我们在只有四个基因的玩具数据上、用一个模拟的 scgen（stub）试过
We tried it on toy data with four genes, and a stand-in for scgen:

6
00:00:18,948 --> 00:00:20,780
setup 顺利跑完，没有任何报错
setup runs, no complaints.

7
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:24,432
可网络会按一千个基因来建，而不是四个
But the network would be built for one thousand genes, not four.

8
00:00:24,752 --> 00:00:27,034
报错没了，bug 还在
The error is gone, and the bug is not.

9
00:00:27,354 --> 00:00:30,341
要弄明白原因，我们得跟着一个名字走过五个地方
To see why, follow one name through five places.

10
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:37,038
先看看你旁观 Josh 工作时的那套环境：三个窗口
First, the setup you watched Josh work in: three windows.

11
00:00:37,358 --> 00:00:42,648
包的代码文件、配置文件，还有运行它们的 e24_replica notebook
The package file, the config file, and the e24_replica notebook that runs them.

12
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,499
两根线把它们连起来
Two wires connect them.

13
00:00:44,549 --> 00:00:47,841
可编辑安装，也就是 pip install 里的 -e
The editable install, the dash e in pip install,

14
00:00:47,841 --> 00:00:51,888
意味着 Python 导入的是你的文件夹本身，而不是一份冻结的副本
means Python imports your folder itself, not a frozen copy.

15
00:00:52,208 --> 00:00:57,136
notebook 顶部的 autoreload 会在文件改动后重新读取它
And autoreload, at the top of the notebook, re-reads the file whenever it changes.

16
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:00,399
配置这根线更简单：每新建一个 Experiment
The config wire is even simpler. Every new

17
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:05,492
它都会用 yaml.safe_load 重新打开并读取 config.yaml
Experiment opens config.yaml and reads it fresh, with yaml.safe_load.

18
00:01:05,734 --> 00:01:09,553
所以循环就是：改文件、重跑那个单元格、看哪里坏了
So the loop is: edit a file, rerun the cell, read what breaks.

19
00:01:09,873 --> 00:01:12,128
你看到 Josh 来回切换，做的就是这个循环
That loop is what you watched Josh do.

20
00:01:15,767 --> 00:01:19,692
现在跟踪一个值：潜空间大小 z_dimension，等于 50
Now follow one value: the latent size, z_dimension, fifty.

21
00:01:20,012 --> 00:01:23,003
第一跳：它是 config.yaml 里的一行
Hop one: it's a line in config.yaml,

22
00:01:23,003 --> 00:01:25,580
位于 models 下面的 scGenModel 里
under models, under scGenModel.

23
00:01:25,734 --> 00:01:30,603
第二跳：safe_load 把整个文件变成层层嵌套的 Python 字典
Hop two: safe load turns the whole file into nested Python dictionaries.

24
00:01:30,603 --> 00:01:35,675
字典就像一排贴着标签的抽屉：必须用一模一样的标签才能打开
A dictionary is a row of labelled drawers. You open one by its exact label.

25
00:01:35,834 --> 00:01:39,354
第三跳：Experiment 的 setup 在第 115 行
Hop three: the experiment's setup, at line 115,

26
00:01:39,354 --> 00:01:42,425
把 scGenModel 这一格（一个小字典）交给 scGenModel 类
hands the scGenModel drawer to the class,

27
00:01:42,425 --> 00:01:45,946
init 打开标着 z_dimension 的抽屉
and init opens the drawer labelled z_dimension.

28
00:01:46,266 --> 00:01:51,108
第四跳：init 把值写到对象身上，成为 self.z_dimension
Hop four: init writes the value onto the object, as self.z_dimension.

29
00:01:51,267 --> 00:01:57,727
第五个地方：模型自己的 setup 方法在第 254 行读取这个属性来搭建网络
Fifth, the model's own setup method, at line 254, reads that attribute to build the network.

30
00:01:57,727 --> 00:02:02,853
注意，等号左边的名字是 scgen 自己的参数名
Careful there: the name left of the equals sign is scgen's own parameter.

31
00:02:02,853 --> 00:02:05,030
我们的名字是 self. 后面那个
Ours is the one after self dot.

32
00:02:05,030 --> 00:02:08,962
五个地方，每一处的拼写都必须一致
Five places, and the spelling has to match at every one.

33
00:02:08,962 --> 00:02:11,982
这就是 Josh 不停在文件之间跳来跳去的原因
That's why Josh kept jumping between files.

34
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:21,597
这条路上有两种查找，失败时各报各的错
That path has two kinds of lookup, and each one fails with its own error.

35
00:02:21,597 --> 00:02:25,060
打开一个不存在的抽屉，会抛出 KeyError
Opening a drawer that doesn't exist raises a key error.

36
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:29,971
向对象要一个它从没得到过的属性，会抛出 AttributeError
Asking an object for an attribute it never received raises an attribute error.

37
00:02:30,133 --> 00:02:35,061
停下来猜一猜：Josh 的 toy config 里写的是带 s 的 x_dimensions
Pause and predict: Josh's toy config spells it x_dimensions, with an s.

38
00:02:35,381 --> 00:02:38,261
init 会抛出 KeyError，还是 AttributeError？
Will init raise a key error, or an attribute error?

39
00:02:42,433 --> 00:02:43,684
是 KeyError
A key error.

40
00:02:43,734 --> 00:02:49,012
用 toy config 构建 scGenModel，init 会停在第 220 行
Build scGenModel from the toy config, and init stops at line 220:

41
00:02:49,012 --> 00:02:51,692
KeyError: 'x_dimension'，单数
key error, x_dimension, singular.

42
00:02:52,012 --> 00:02:53,812
它要找的那个抽屉不存在
The drawer it asked for isn't there.

43
00:02:53,933 --> 00:02:57,533
第 253 行的崩溃就是 AttributeError
And the attribute error is our crash at line 253:

44
00:02:57,533 --> 00:03:03,704
模型的 setup 要的是 self.x_dimensions，而 init 只写过单数形式
the model's setup asks for self.x_dimensions, but init only ever wrote the singular.

45
00:03:03,867 --> 00:03:06,171
读 traceback 要从最底下开始
To read a traceback, start at the bottom.

46
00:03:06,491 --> 00:03:10,368
最后一行告诉你出了什么错，这里 Python 甚至会问
The last line says what went wrong, and here Python even asks:

47
00:03:10,368 --> 00:03:12,168
你是不是想写 x_dimension？
did you mean x_dimension?

48
00:03:12,251 --> 00:03:15,003
再往上，最后一个文件和行号告诉你错在哪里
Just above it, the last file and line says where.

49
00:03:15,323 --> 00:03:18,205
继续往上读，就能看到调用路径
Read further up and you see the path:

50
00:03:18,205 --> 00:03:24,048
Experiment 的 setup 在第 119 行，调用了模型的 setup，在第 253 行
the experiment's setup, at line 119, called the model's setup, at line 253.

51
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:27,974
提醒一句：这是用替身 scgen 测到的
One caution: we measured this with a stand-in for scgen.

52
00:03:27,974 --> 00:03:33,501
在集群上，可能会先出现另一个和 scgen 有关的报错，第四集会解释原因
On the cluster, a different scgen error can come first. Episode four explains why.

53
00:03:39,867 --> 00:03:41,545
现在是不报错的那一半
Now the silent part.

54
00:03:41,595 --> 00:03:43,260
当 use_all_genes 为真时
When use_all_genes is true,

55
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:48,018
Experiment 的 setup 本该用从数据里读到的真实基因数
the experiment's setup is meant to replace the typed gene count with the real one,

56
00:03:48,018 --> 00:03:49,758
替换手写的基因数
read from the data.

57
00:03:49,808 --> 00:03:51,664
第 104 行做的就是这件事
Line 104 does that.

58
00:03:51,834 --> 00:03:55,269
可第 104 行写入的是带 s 的 x_dimensions
But line 104 writes x_dimensions, with an s.

59
00:03:55,589 --> 00:04:00,751
往一个不存在的标签里写值，从来不会报错：Python 只会新加一个抽屉
Writing to a label that doesn't exist never complains: Python just adds a new drawer.

60
00:04:01,071 --> 00:04:06,473
于是字典里出现了两个抽屉：单数的 x_dimension，手写的 1000
So the dictionary ends up with two drawers: x_dimension, singular, one thousand,

61
00:04:06,473 --> 00:04:10,458
还有带 s 的 x_dimensions，真实的基因数
typed by hand, and x_dimensions, with an s, the real count.

62
00:04:10,634 --> 00:04:16,138
init 只打开单数的那个抽屉，于是真实的基因数落进了一个没人读的抽屉
Init only opens the singular drawer, so the real count lands in a drawer nobody reads.

63
00:04:16,458 --> 00:04:17,958
在 Josh 的真实数据上
On Josh's real data,

64
00:04:17,958 --> 00:04:22,367
他的 notebook 曾经打印过这个抽屉：18,024
his notebook once printed that drawer: eighteen thousand and twenty-four.

65
00:04:22,687 --> 00:04:24,799
按现在的 init，没有人读它
With today's init, nothing reads it.

66
00:04:24,967 --> 00:04:28,810
在这里停一下：基因数真的应该手写进配置里吗？
Pause on this: should the gene count be typed into the config at all,

67
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:30,983
还是应该永远从数据里来？
or should it always come from the data?

68
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:42,801
下面四条规则，能把这种来回折腾变成一套固定流程
Four rules turn this back-and-forth into a routine.

69
00:04:42,967 --> 00:04:44,412
第一，只用一种拼写
One: one spelling.

70
00:04:44,412 --> 00:04:48,706
配置里的键、init 里的那一行、对象的属性，用同一个名字
The config key, the init line, and the attribute share exactly one name.

71
00:04:48,706 --> 00:04:54,508
第二，能推导出来的值就推导：数据能告诉你的数字，不要手写
Two: derived values are derived. A number the data can tell you shouldn't be typed by hand.

72
00:04:54,667 --> 00:04:56,324
第三，尽早失败
Three: fail early.

73
00:04:56,374 --> 00:05:00,022
init 在对象建好的那一刻就读取了所有键
Init already reads every key the moment the object is built.

74
00:05:00,342 --> 00:05:04,779
这很好：缺一个键，会在 init 里就爆出来，而不是训练一小时之后
That's good: a missing key explodes inside init, not an hour into training.

75
00:05:04,933 --> 00:05:10,603
第四，任何改名之后，都在整个项目里搜索旧名字，包括 YAML 文件
Four: after any rename, search the whole project for the old name, YAML files included.

76
00:05:10,603 --> 00:05:13,275
然后重跑手头最小的例子
Then rerun the smallest example you have.

77
00:05:13,433 --> 00:05:17,337
今天就该检查的两个坑：Josh 的 toy config 已经和代码对不上了
Two traps to check today. Josh's toy config has drifted:

78
00:05:17,337 --> 00:05:21,241
它没有 experiment 段，setup 会停在第 86 行
it has no experiment section, so setup stops at line 86,

79
00:05:21,241 --> 00:05:25,006
它也缺少 z_dimension、alpha 和 dropout_rate
and it also lacks z_dimension, alpha and dropout rate.

80
00:05:25,006 --> 00:05:28,492
另外，在 YAML 里 None 只是一个普通单词、一个字符串
And in YAML, None is just the word None, a string.

81
00:05:28,492 --> 00:05:30,723
YAML 的空值写作 null
YAML spells an empty value null.

82
00:05:30,723 --> 00:05:35,812
今天这还没有害处，但任何判断是否为 None 的检查都会悄悄出错
That's harmless today, but any check for None would quietly get it wrong.

83
00:05:40,833 --> 00:05:44,732
回顾一下。一个配置值要经过五个地方
Recap. A config value passes through five places:

84
00:05:44,732 --> 00:05:50,220
YAML 的一行、字典的抽屉、init、对象属性，以及读取它的 setup
a YAML line, a dictionary drawer, init, an attribute, and the setup that reads it.

85
00:05:50,540 --> 00:05:52,502
每个地方拼写都必须相同
Every place needs the same spelling.

86
00:05:52,666 --> 00:05:55,126
KeyError 说明少了一个抽屉
A key error means a drawer is missing.

87
00:05:55,126 --> 00:05:59,075
AttributeError 说明对象身上从没写过这个属性
An attribute error means the object never got that attribute.

88
00:05:59,075 --> 00:06:02,053
而且，一个不报错的 bug 可能就藏在一个被修好的崩溃后面
And a quiet bug can hide behind a fixed crash.

89
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:07,768
你的练习：在整个项目里搜索两种拼写，保留单数的 x_dimension
Your exercise: search the project for both spellings, and keep the singular, x_dimension.

90
00:06:08,088 --> 00:06:13,805
它已经和 config.yaml、init 一致，也正是 scgen 自己的参数名
It already matches config.yaml and init, and it's the name of scgen's own parameter.

91
00:06:14,125 --> 00:06:20,973
把第 104 行、第 253 行等号右边，以及 toy config 改成一致
Change line 104, the right-hand side of line 253, and the toy config to match.

92
00:06:21,293 --> 00:06:23,241
然后重跑 e24_replica
Then rerun e24_replica,

93
00:06:23,241 --> 00:06:28,828
检查模型的 x_dimension 现在是不是真实的基因数
and check that the model's x_dimension is now the real gene count,

94
00:06:28,828 --> 00:06:32,045
即使 setup 仍然停在第 252 行
even if setup still stops at line 252.

95
00:06:32,365 --> 00:06:34,541
那一处会在第四集解释
Episode four explains that stop.
